    "title": "MBBS results for 2010 out",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Aga Khan University announces its MBBS Final Examination results for the year 2010, held in the month of September. A total of 89 students are declared to have passed MBBS from the University this year.",
    "media": [
