      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Aga Khan University announces its MBBS Final Examination results for the year 2010, held in the month of September. A total of 89 students are declared to have passed MBBS from the University this year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Taking a lead from the rest, three students - all females - have passed the examination with honours. Ameera Javaid Ahmed has secured honours in the subjects of Medicine and Family Medicine, Sana Khalid in Surgery and Mehreen Teizoon Kisat also in Family Medicine."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
